    "No direct oral bioavailability record for the query molecule (mifepristone scaffold) is present in the supplied cards.",
    "No matched oral versus IV exposure data for the query; transfer relies on structurally related non-steroidal contexts.",
    "No query-specific solubility, dissolution, or first-pass metabolism measurements; the unfavorable physicochemical prior is not affirmative low-F evidence.",
    "All reference contexts are non-steroidal, so transferability to a steroidal scaffold is uncertain."
  ],
